      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "RGBA builds a color from how much red, green and blue light it has, each 0 to 1. Red rises left to right and green bottom to top, from World Coordinates; an Oscillator swings the blue up and down once a loop. Pull a cable out and drag that channel by hand, or swap the X and Y cables."
        }
      },
